---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="About articles.kwon.ai — a personal article archive by Daniel Kwon."
>
  <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl flex-1 px-6 py-16">
    <header class="mb-10">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">About</h1>
    </header>

    <article class="prose article-prose max-w-none">
      <p>
        A personal article archive by Daniel Kwon — a permanent home for
        research notes, technical writeups, and references he wants to keep
        and share.
      </p>
      <p>
        Most pieces here started as Claude Code sessions: Daniel asks for a
        structured information document, Claude writes a self-contained
        article, and Daniel publishes the ones worth sharing. Pieces tied to
        his specific situation stay private; everything you can read here
        passed that filter.
      </p>
      <p>
        The site is built with <a href="https://astro.build/">Astro</a>, the
        <a href="https://ui.shadcn.com/">shadcn/ui</a> design tokens, and
        <a href="https://vercel.com/font">Geist</a>. Source at
        <a href="https://github.com/danieljbk/articles"
          >github.com/danieljbk/articles</a
        >.
      </p>
      <p>
        For Daniel's other work, see
        <a href="https://kwon.ai">kwon.ai</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
